WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Prepare the pair
Read the release notes. Preserve required files. Stop tools and use stable power. APK installation and firmware flashing are separate.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Use Updates
Select the correct board and release. Review verification status. Keep USB connected while the app writes and verifies firmware.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Reconnect and confirm
After completion, reconnect to companion mode. Check the reported firmware version and a benign device-info reply.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
If flashing fails
Keep the error and version details. Follow the board bootloader procedure and recover with the matching image. Never treat an incomplete upload as success.
